{
  "version": "M365-1.5 (2026-11-04)",
  "sources": {
    "verb_levels": "https://learn.microsoft.com/powershell/scripting/developer/cmdlet/approved-verbs-for-windows-powershell-commands (100 approved verbs, fetched 2026-09-15). Where, ForEach, Sort and Tee are not approved verbs but are the verbs of Where-Object, ForEach-Object, Sort-Object and Tee-Object, so they stay. The level is Microsoft's verb meaning read as tenant impact: Get/Find/Search/... read, Set/New/Add/... change, Remove/Clear/Uninstall delete. Import, Join, Request, Skip, Hide, Connect and Disconnect moved to CHANGES on 2026-10-09: Microsoft 365 modules use them for writes (Import-TransportRuleCollection, Request-SPOPersonalSite, Join-MgSiteContentTypeWithHubSite, Skip-MgDeviceManagementManagedDeviceActivationLock, Hide-MgChatForUser, Connect-Mailbox), and the sign-in cmdlets are an override. Unapproved verbs Exchange and Purview use: Delete (Delete-QuarantineMessage) deletes; Release, Rotate, Upgrade, Expedite, Cancel, Execute, Redirect, Retry, Clean change; Preview reads. Checked against the Graph SDK MgCommandMetadata.json (Microsoft.Graph.Authentication 2.41.1: the HTTP method of all 27,242 Graph cmdlets) and the Learn and PnP page of each cmdlet named here, fetched 2026-10-09.",
    "cmdlet_overrides": "Search-Mailbox and New-ComplianceSearchAction pages under https://learn.microsoft.com/powershell/module/exchange/ (fetched 2026-09-15)",
    "undo": "each docs URL, fetched 2026-09-15; the retention figures are quoted from those pages",
    "M365-1.4": "Rows added 2026-11-04 from the 0.5.1 review. Graph cmdlet names and HTTP methods checked against MgCommandMetadata.json in Microsoft.Graph.Authentication 2.41.2, and the Invoke-GraphRequest, Invoke-MgRestMethod, Connect-Graph and Disconnect-Graph aliases against that module's manifest and assembly; the review's Invoke-MgWipe/Purge/PermanentDelete names do not exist there (those actions are Clear-Mg and Remove-Mg...Permanent cmdlets, already DESTRUCTIVE by verb). Exchange and Purview names checked against the Learn module index (exchangepowershell, fetched 2026-11-04), Import-JournalRuleCollection against its Learn page ('removes or overwrites all pre-existing journal rules'), PnP names against the PnP.PowerShell 3.4.1 manifest, Invoke-MSGraphRequest's -HttpMethod, -Url and -Content against the Microsoft.Graph.Intune help file. known_hosts additions are named in the Microsoft 365 worldwide endpoint list (endpoints.office.com, read 2026-11-04). Entra names checked against the Microsoft.Entra.Users, Applications, DirectoryManagement, SignIns, Groups and Governance manifests, Az names against Az.Resources and Az.KeyVault, MSOnline names against the MSOnline package, SharePoint Online names against its help file and Learn pages, and the 49 local Windows cmdlets against their Learn pages (2026-11-04). Native program switches checked against the Windows Commands pages on Learn; bcdedit recoveryenabled against the Windows boot troubleshooting page; sc failure has no Learn page."
  },
  "verb_levels": {
